{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "_comment": "變異測試：把程式改壞，看測試會不會紅。覆蓋率只說「這行跑過」，變異分數說「這行壞掉會不會被抓到」——後端的 cargo-mutants 就是靠這個抓到四個斷言缺口。範圍刻意只涵蓋抽出來的純邏輯模組：那些是變異測試唯一划算的地方（快、決定性、每個突變都對應一個真的行為改變）。整個 src 跑一次要數十分鐘，而元件的突變大多產生無意義的等價變體。",
  "packageManager": "pnpm",
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "plugins": ["@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"],
  "_plugins_comment": "pnpm 的嚴格 node_modules 下 Stryker 自動掃不到 plugin，要顯式列出，否則報 \"no TestRunner plugins were loaded\"。",
  "vitest": {
    "configFile": "vitest.config.ts"
  },
  "mutate": [
    "src/components/apps/finder/history.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/marquee.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/move.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/rename.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/selection.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/sorting.ts",
    "src/components/apps/finder/tabs.ts",
    "src/components/desktop/icon-grid.ts",
    "src/components/mobile/sheets.ts",
    "src/features/files/tus-upload.ts",
    "src/lib/a11y.ts",
    "src/lib/errors.ts",
    "src/lib/format.ts",
    "src/lib/paths.ts"
  ],
  "ignorePatterns": [
    "node_modules",
    "dist",
    "target",
    "backend",
    "packages",
    "coverage",
    "reports",
    ".lighthouseci",
    "playwright-report",
    "test-results",
    "e2e",
    "public",
    ".git",
    ".github"
  ],
  "_ignore_comment": "沒有這段的話 Stryker 會把 node_modules 一起算進專案（實測 54031 個檔案），然後複製整包到 sandbox —— 表現成卡在 \"Creating test runner process(es)\" 不動。",
  "reporters": ["clear-text", "progress", "html", "json"],
  "htmlReporter": {
    "fileName": "reports/mutation/index.html"
  },
  "concurrency": 2,
  "timeoutMS": 20000,
  "thresholds": {
    "high": 100,
    "low": 95,
    "break": 95
  },
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "reports/mutation/mutation.json"
  },
  "_thresholds_comment": "實測 100.00%（226 killed / 0 survived）。break 設 95 是**棘輪**留 5pp 餘裕：加一段還沒測到的新邏輯不該當場擋下，但把既有斷言刪弱會被抓到。"
}
